      <h1 id="apiservice-apiregistration-k8s-io-v1" class="group scroll-mt-20">APIService [apiregistration.k8s.io/v1]<a href="#apiservice-apiregistration-k8s-io-v1" class="ml-2 text-muted-foreground opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 no-underline" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1">&para;</a></h1>
